            "annotation": "samtools view -b -q 20 -f 2 -F 3852. -F 3852 is 4+8+256+512+1024+2048: unmapped, mate unmapped, secondary, QC fail, duplicate, supplementary. What survives is the set of reads whose aligned subsequence over a window can be trusted as a string.",
