            "type": "tool",
            "label": "call_haplotypes",
            "annotation": "Maps over the BAM collection; every specimen gets the same windows. Specimen id left blank so the tool uses the collection element identifier. The haplotype is read off reads that span a window end to end, so it is an observation on one molecule rather than an inference across molecules, which lets mixtures be told apart from a single strain carrying the same mutations.",
